{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crystal Keepers </strong>is a cooperative action game for up to 4 players, where you will face  waves of relentless enemies, including challenging bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive as a team by creating strategies, discovering synergies, and unleashing your full potential with coordinated attacks, abilities, and items to make it to the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492560/extras/DV-Gameplay.gif?t=1746223209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Choose your class</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select from a variety of classes to suit your playstyle and create creative builds to make each match unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492560/extras/DV-Character.gif?t=1746223209\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Make your character</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your hero with a unique combination of abilities and passives, acquired as you level up, allowing for creative strategies and powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492560/extras/DV-Inventory.gif?t=1746223209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between waves, acquire items with no inventory restrictions to further enhance your build. With six rarity levels for items, cards, and enemies, every match offers a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase items to dominate the battlefield and evolve your Guardian. Play solo or with friends and dive into this adventure!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3492560?t=1746223209","background_raw":"https://sha